{
  "date": "2025-02-13",
  "messages": [
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "난 템피 와있어! 여긴 전 도시랑도 또 시차가 있어서 시간 체감이 잘 안된다 ㅠㅠ",
      "en": "I'm in Tempe! This city has a different time zone from the last one too, so I can't really keep track of time anymore.ㅠㅠ"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "머하구 있어",
      "en": "What are you up to?"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "난 아침으로",
      "en": "For breakfast,"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "미국 햄버거",
      "en": "I had an American burger,"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "야무지게 먹고",
      "en": "and enjoyed it properly."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "저녁은 한식 먹을라구",
      "en": "I'm planning to have Korean food for dinner."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "내일은 그래두 데이오프라",
      "en": "At least tomorrow is a day off,"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "에너지를 조금더 충전할수 있을듯!!",
      "en": "so I think I'll be able to recharge a bit more!!"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "아니 전 도시에서",
      "en": "Oh, in the previous city,"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "스테이크 먹었는디",
      "en": "we had steak,"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "너무 웃겼음ㅎㅋㅎㅋㄹㄹ",
      "en": "and it was so funnyㅎㅋㅎㅋㄹㄹ"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "갑자기 현장체험 학습처럼",
      "en": "Out of nowhere, it turned into what felt like a school field trip."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "주방데려가거",
      "en": "They took us into the kitchen,"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "너네가 먹을 고기야! 어디부위줄까?",
      "en": "and were like, 'This is the beef you'll be eating! Which cut do you want?'"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "이런거 하고",
      "en": "Stuff like that."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "반다나랑 카우보이 모자 씌워주고",
      "en": "Then they put bandanas and cowboy hats on us,"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "사진찍어주심",
      "en": "and took pictures for us."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "ㅋㄹㅋㄹㅋㄹㅋㄹㅋㄹㄹㅋㄹㅋ",
      "en": "ㅋㄹㅋㄹㅋㄹㅋㄹㅋㄹㄹㅋㄹㅋ"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "아니",
      "en": "Seriously,"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "다들 그냥 먹으러 와서",
      "en": "everyone had just come to eat,"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "수척한 상태에서",
      "en": "looking completely worn out,"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "그러고있으니까 너무 웃긴곀ㄹㅋㄹㄹ",
      "en": "so seeing us all like that made it even funnierㅋㄹㅋㄹㄹ"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "그리고 디저트 시켜서",
      "en": "Then we ordered dessert,"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "투어단톡방에서",
      "en": "and in our tour group chat,"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "누가 제일 잘찍었나",
      "en": "we had a competition"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "대결도하고",
      "en": "to see who took the best photo."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "우리 사진찍은거 프린트까지 해주심",
      "en": "They even printed out the photos we took."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "좋은 추억이였따",
      "en": "It turned into a really nice memory."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "마자",
      "en": "Oh, right."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "어제 호텔에서",
      "en": "Yesterday at the hotel,"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "기이한",
      "en": "something"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "상황",
      "en": "really strange"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "발생",
      "en": "happened."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "아니",
      "en": "So,"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "내가 씻고있었는데",
      "en": "I was taking a shower,"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "나경언니가",
      "en": "and I heard Nakyung unnie"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "문바로 앞에서",
      "en": "right outside the bathroom door"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "헤~~",
      "en": "\"Hee~~~\""
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "이러는거야",
      "en": "like that."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "나 놀릴려고",
      "en": "I thought she was teasing me."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "너무 나경언니 목소리였어",
      "en": "It sounded exactly like Nakyung unnie's voice."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "헤~ 이러길랴",
      "en": "I heard, 'Hee~,'"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "뭐라고??",
      "en": "so I said, 'What??'"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "이랬는데",
      "en": "But then..."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "언니가",
      "en": "she said,"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "뭐?",
      "en": "'Huh?'"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "뭔소리야",
      "en": "'What are you talking about?'"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "언니가 문앞에서 뭐 하지않았냐",
      "en": "I asked, 'Weren't you doing something outside the door?'"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "난 여기서 아무 소리를 안내고있었다",
      "en": "She said, 'I haven't made a single sound over here.'"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "이래서",
      "en": "And when she said that..."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "씻는대 무서운겨",
      "en": "taking a shower suddenly became really scary."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "ㅋㄹㅋㄹㅋㄹㅋㄹ",
      "en": "ㅋㄹㅋㄹㅋㄹㅋㄹ"
    },
        {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "나가서 얘기해 아무말도 하지마봐",
      "en": "Come out first, and don't say anything."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "이러거",
      "en": "So I said that,"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "나가서",
      "en": "then I came out,"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "말하는데",
      "en": "and while we were talking,"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "분명 헤 소리 들리고 언니 달그락 거리는 소리 들려서",
      "en": "I was sure I had heard the 'He~' sound and the noises of unnie moving around."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "언니구나 했다니까",
      "en": "I was convinced it was her."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "목소리 낸적이 없대!!",
      "en": "But she said she never made a sound!!"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "다 걸고",
      "en": "She swore on everything"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "아무소리를",
      "en": "that she"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "안냈대",
      "en": "hadn't made any noise."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "무서우니까 우리 그만 말하자",
      "en": "\"This is too creepy, let's stop talking about it.\""
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "이러구 나는 거실에서 가방싸고",
      "en": "So I packed my luggage in the living room,"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "이제 언니가 씻으러갔는데",
      "en": "and then unnie went to take a shower."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "voice": "voice-01.mp3"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "이런 소리가",
      "en": "Then this kind of sound"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "났어",
      "en": "came from inside."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "ㄹㅇ",
      "en": "Seriously."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "나경언니",
      "en": "From where Nakyung unnie"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "씻는 곳에서",
      "en": "was showering."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "그래서",
      "en": "So"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "뭐라고???",
      "en": "I was like, \"What???\""
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "하면서 갔더니",
      "en": "and went over,"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "나경언니 안에서",
      "en": "and from inside,"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "무서워가지고",
      "en": "Nakyung unnie, sounding terrified,"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "하지말라고!!!",
      "en": "was yelling, \"Stop it!!!\""
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "나 아무말도 안했다거!!!!",
      "en": "\"I didn't say anything!!!!\""
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "자꾸 뭘듣는건뎅ㅇ!!!!!!",
      "en": "\"What do you keep hearing!!!!!!\""
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "이러면서 빛의속도로 씻고나옴",
      "en": "She finished showering at the speed of light and came right out."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "그전에",
      "en": "Before that,"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "나경언니가",
      "en": "Nakyung unnie had said,"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "나 씻는동안",
      "en": "\"While I'm showering,"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "문앞근처에 있어줘 ㅠㅠㅠ",
      "en": "stay near the bathroom door for me.ㅠㅠㅠ\""
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "이랬는데",
      "en": "She'd said that,"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "내가 거실로가서",
      "en": "but I'd gone into the living room,"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "하연아 거기있어?",
      "en": "so I thought she was asking,"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "이런 느낌의 질문을 하는줄 알고",
      "en": "\"Hayeon, are you still there?\""
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "내가",
      "en": "So I"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "뭐라고? 하면서 간거였는데",
      "en": "went over saying, \"What?\""
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "무서웠음",
      "en": "It was so creepy."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "아닠ㅎㄹㄹㄹㄹㄹ",
      "en": "아닠ㅎㄹㄹㄹㄹㄹ"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "나경언니가",
      "en": "Nakyung unnie said,"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "한국귀신은 안무서운데",
      "en": "\"I'm not scared of Korean ghosts,"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "미국귀신은 말이 안통해서",
      "en": "but American ghosts don't speak Korean,"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "모르겠다고",
      "en": "so I don't know what they're saying.\""
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "너무 웃기고 무서우었음ㅋㄹㅋㄹㅋㄹㅋㄹ",
      "en": "It was so funny and so scary at the same timeㅋㄹㅋㄹㅋㄹㅋㄹ"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "배구파",
      "en": "I'm hungry."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "밥 언제오아아아앙",
      "en": "When is my food getting hereaaahhh?"
    },
        {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "오 왔대!!",
      "en": "Oh, it's here!!"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "나 밥만 받고 올게",
      "en": "I'll go grab my food and be right back."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "기둘비둘",
      "en": "Wait just a sec."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "세팅 완료!",
      "en": "All set!"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "두부랑 김치찌개 불고기",
      "en": "I ordered tofu, kimchi stew, and bulgogi."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "시켜쓰",
      "en": "That's what I got."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "야무지게 먹어야징ㅇ",
      "en": "Time to enjoy my meal properly."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "voice": "voice-02.mp3"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "낼 시간날때 또 오도록 해보게쓰!",
      "en": "If I have some free time tomorrow, I'll come back again!"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "하랑해~~🥳🥳",
      "en": "Haranghae~~🥳🥳"
    }
  ]
}